```

> **What happens when you run this page?**  
> 1. The map asks for `cache://tiles/…` tiles.  
> 2. `cacheProtocolHandler` looks in IndexedDB.  
> 3. If the tile is present, it returns the cached `ArrayBuffer`.  
> 4. If not, it fetches the tile from `https://my.tileserver.com/…`, stores it, and returns it.  
> 5. Subsequent visits (or panning/zooming back to the same tile) hit the IndexedDB cache, so the network request is avoided.

